drafts.tidy:
I stand before the sky as God who weaves the clouds in night,
My thunder crowns the storm I raise above these trembling ground;
All winds obey my call, and every heart below feels the touch.

In the arena of steel we rise as storm,
and fire ignites my blade with thunder's roar;
the foe shall tremble when his sword is out of trial.

